---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import catHouse from '../../assets/about/cat-house.png';
---
<Layout
  title="About us"
  lang="en"
  description="Amateur cattery breeding Sacred Birman and Kurilian Bobtail cats: philosophy, experience and affiliations."
>
  <h1>About us</h1>
  <div class="rule"></div>

  <p>
    Our Sacred Birman cattery was born in 2008, from Diego's desire to take a new
    direction from the old Golden Rock cattery, which he had shared with someone
    else until then. All the Golden Rock cats stayed with us, letting us carry on
    the breeding programme Diego had already started and improve it with new
    bloodlines from some of the most prestigious European catteries. The excellent
    work done over the years means all our cats, first Golden Rock and now
    Sacro &amp; Profano, share a very recognisable look.
  </p>

  <h2>Our philosophy</h2>
  <p>
    Our breeding philosophy doesn't chase "aesthetic perfection" at all costs -
    our cats' health always comes first.
  </p>

  <div class="cat-house-section">
    <div>
      <h2>A real cat-house</h2>
      <p>
        All our cats live at home with us and share our everyday family life…
        napping on sofas and beds. They have plenty of scratching trees to play
        on and keep their claws in shape. Our house is built cat-first… wide
        terraces where they can sunbathe and watch the birds safely, shelves
        running around the walls at height, and little ladders or scratching
        posts to bring them back down to the floor… in short, ours is a real
        "cat-house".
      </p>
    </div>
    <Image class="cat-house-photo" src={catHouse} alt="Our cats at home, among sofas, scratching posts and shelves" width={431} height={524} />
  </div>

  <h2>Affiliations</h2>
  <p>
    List the relevant cat associations here (e.g. ANFI, ENFI, FIFe) and how many
    years you've been a member - it goes a long way toward credibility with anyone
    looking for a serious cattery.
  </p>

  <h2>Where we are</h2>
  <p>
    City/region and, if you'd like, details on visiting the cattery by appointment.
  </p>
</Layout>

<style>
  .rule {
    height: 2px;
    width: 6rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 1.75rem;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--brass), transparent 90%);
  }

  .cat-house-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 280px;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .cat-house-photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--brass);
    border-radius: 20px 6px 6px 6px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cat-house-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cat-house-photo { max-width: 320px; }
  }
</style>
